[0.197, "o", "[2/4] PowerDNS deployment running in the kind cluster.\r\n[3/4] Local API port-forward ready at http://127.0.0.1:18081 (header: X-API-Key: pdns4kube-dev-key)\r\n      Local DNS port-forward ready at 127.0.0.1:1053 (try: dig +tcp @127.0.0.1 -p 1053 example.org NS)\r\n[4/4] Launching operator locally (press Ctrl+C to stop)...\r\nHandling connection for 1053"]
